ent-WGUndergroundMarketPass = market pass
    .desc = Points its holder to the Underground's market. It burns out thirty minutes after it is handed over.
ent-WGBallisticTurretHeavyAIUnderground = Underground heavy remote sentry turret
    .desc = A heavy turret guarding the Underground's market. It is loaded with live rounds and spares only the market's own people.
ent-WGContractBoardUG = Underground job board
    .desc = Lists paid work for the Underground's own people. It pays in thalers.
